{
  "id": "E065",
  "title": "Overcharging Taxi Drivers",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-11-19",
  "synopsis": "Taxi drivers might overcharge you if you are not a native citizen. Here are some tips on what you can do about it.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/274/36c19751d17f3edeea0c8c621f2cdb520018aa0d.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "对付多要价的出租车司机\n\n（在机场）\n乘客：您好，我要去市中心\n司机：去市中心230元，不打表。\n乘客：您别开玩笑了，我虽然是个外国人，可是在这里住了5年了。打表就80元。\n司机：那我不去，您找别的车吧。\n乘客：您这是拒载，我可以投诉的，我看看您的车牌号……\n司机：好好好，上车上车。\n乘客：麻烦打表！",
    "traditional": "對付多要價的出租車司機\n\n（在機場）\n乘客：您好，我要去市中心\n司機：去市中心230元，不打錶。\n乘客：您別開玩笑了，我雖然是個外國人，可是在這裡住了5年了。打錶就80元。\n司機：那我不去，您找別的車吧。\n乘客：您這是拒載，我可以投訴的，我看看您的車牌號……\n司機：好好好，上車上車。\n乘客：麻煩打錶！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dealing With Overcharging Taxi Drivers"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "（在机场）",
      "traditional": "（在機場）",
      "pinyin": "zài jī chǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(At the airport)"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "乘客：您好，我要去市中心",
      "traditional": "乘客：您好，我要去市中心",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè nín hǎo wǒ yào qù shì zhōng xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Hello, I want to go to downtown."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "司机：去市中心230元，不打表。",
      "traditional": "司機：去市中心230元，不打錶。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī qù shì zhōng xīn 4 yuán bù dǎ biǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Going to downtown is 230RMB, without turning on the meter."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "乘客：您别开玩笑了，我虽然是个外国人，可是在这里住了5年了。",
      "traditional": "乘客：您別開玩笑了，我雖然是個外國人，可是在這裡住了5年了。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè nín bié kāi wán xiào le wǒ suī rán shì ge wài guó rén kě shì zài zhè lǐ zhù le 1 nián le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "打表就80元。",
      "traditional": "打錶就80元。",
      "pinyin": "dǎ biǎo jiù 2 yuán",
      "english": "Passenger: Don’t joke with me. Although I am a foreigner, I have been living here for 5 years."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It costs 80RMB if you run the meter."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "司机：那我不去，您找别的车吧。",
      "traditional": "司機：那我不去，您找別的車吧。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī nà wǒ bú qù nín zhǎo bié de chē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Then I won’t take you. You can find another taxi."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "乘客：您这是拒载，我可以投诉的，我看看您的车牌号……",
      "traditional": "乘客：您這是拒載，我可以投訴的，我看看您的車牌號……",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè nín zhè shì jù zài wǒ kě yǐ tóu sù de wǒ kàn kan nín de chē pái hào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: You are declining passengers. I could issue a complaint. Let me check your plate number…"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "司机：好好好，上车上车。",
      "traditional": "司機：好好好，上車上車。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo hǎo hǎo shàng chē shàng chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Fine, fine. Get in the car."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "乘客：麻烦打表！",
      "traditional": "乘客：麻煩打錶！",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè má fan dǎ biǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Please run the meter."
    }
  ],
